@startuml i3-lesson-state
' The Lesson (занятие) machine and its arrival kinds — docs/hld/70-i3-alignment.md §70.3 (D15, E4).
' A lesson owns N ordinary SimulationSessions (one per scenario_plan entry); each session keeps
' its own SESSION_TRANSITIONS, incident, clock and event log (INV 5 unchanged).
' Transition labels read: trigger [guard] / who may fire.

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<terminal>> #EEEEEE
}

title Lesson — LESSON_TRANSITIONS and how its sessions are started

state "LESSON (LessonState)" as LESSON {
  [*] --> CREATED : createLesson\n(every plan session created, each READY)
  CREATED --> ACTIVE : start\n[every plan session READY]\n/ INSTRUCTOR
  ACTIVE --> COMPLETED : complete\n[every plan session COMPLETED or ABORTED]\n/ SYSTEM (LessonRunner)
  CREATED --> ABORTED : abort\n(aborts every non-terminal session)\n/ INSTRUCTOR, SYSTEM
  ACTIVE --> ABORTED : abort\n(aborts every non-terminal session)\n/ INSTRUCTOR, SYSTEM
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  ABORTED --> [*]

  state COMPLETED <<terminal>>
  state ABORTED <<terminal>>
}

state "PLAN ENTRY n (its session)" as ENTRY {
  state "session READY\n(card not yet arrived)" as WAITING
  state "arrival condition holds?" as ARR <<choice>>
  state "session ACTIVE\n(card arrived; its timers run)" as RUNNING
  state "session COMPLETED / ABORTED" as DONE <<terminal>>

  [*] --> WAITING
  WAITING --> ARR : LessonRunner tick\n(lesson ACTIVE)
  ARR --> WAITING : no
  ARR --> RUNNING : yes / start_session as\nActorRef(INSTRUCTOR, lesson creator)
  RUNNING --> DONE : the session's own machine
  DONE --> [*]
}

note right of ENTRY
  Arrival kinds (PlanEntry.arrival):
  - AT_OFFSET {offset_ms}: lesson wall ms since
    start >= offset_ms (position 1 must be AT_OFFSET)
  - AFTER_PREVIOUS_112_STAGE {delay_ms}: the previous
    card's OPERATOR_112 stage reached HANDED_OFF
  - AFTER_PREVIOUS_SESSION {delay_ms}: the previous
    card's session is COMPLETED or ABORTED
  503 INFERENCE_NOT_READY from start_session is retried
  next tick and appends nothing. The fired arrival is
  recorded in SESSION_STARTED.lesson_arrival.
end note

note bottom of LESSON
  One asyncio task per ACTIVE lesson, Redis lock
  lock:lesson:{id}:runner, re-adopted on backend start
  (the SimulationRunner discipline, D7). Lessons have no
  event log of their own.
end note

@enduml
